<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Dunloe House Group shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Dunloe House Group shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dunloe House Group Plc were suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending approval of a circular, the Irish property and development company said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom +353 1 661 3377</p>
